{"title":"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When the fraction <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/f/e2ff885ad0a09b277440c7e95b7be7bede254a4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{49}{84}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"38\" /> is expressed in simplest form, then the sum of the numerator and the denominator will be \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/a/31a42c91c77a0c39a1db4464b96280494820365f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 11 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 17 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 19 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 33 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 133$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"384\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/b/f9b96cf59f5d43710d2d9dac3e65a52f1cf60190.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\dfrac{49}{84} &amp;= \\dfrac{7^2}{2^2\\cdot 3\\cdot 7} \\\\ &amp;= \\dfrac{7}{2^2\\cdot 3} \\\\ &amp;= \\dfrac{7}{12}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"107\" height=\"125\" />\n</p><p>The sum of the numerator and denominator is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/3/fe3d9e7bd1bfa5a804fab4b4c39afc54ffdba8e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7+12=19\\rightarrow \\boxed{\\text{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"144\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME\" title=\"1993 AJHSME\">1993 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1993\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problem